  "resolutionInfoContent": "3840 × 2160 — 4K UHD\n2560 × 1440 — 2K QHD\n1920 × 1080 — Full HD\n1280 ×  720 — HD\n 854 ×  480 — 480p\n 640 ×  360 — 360p\n 426 ×  240 — 240p\n\nTip: Leave one field empty = the other will be calculated proportionally.",
  "@resolutionInfoContent": {"description": "Inhalt des Auflösungs-Info-Dialogs"},

