  "resolutionExplainContent": "360p  (640×360)   → very small file,\ne.g. for WhatsApp\n\n480p  (854×480)   → Standard Definition (SD)\n\n720p  (1280×720)  → HD, good for mobile devices\n\n1080p (1920×1080) → Full HD, standard for\n                          YouTube & TV\n\nHigh/Medium/Low describes quality at the same resolution — higher = larger file.",
  "@resolutionExplainContent": {"description": "Inhalt des Auflösungs-Erklärungs-Dialogs"},

